SCENARIO 3: LOST UPDATE (the problem)
Two investigators each read the recovered volume (300 bbl), add the oil THEY
recovered (A: +50, B: +30) in their application, and write the total back.
Correct final value: 300 + 50 + 30 = 380.
==============================================================================
[  0.00s] A> BEGIN
           A  -> BEGIN
[  0.00s] B> BEGIN
           B  -> BEGIN
[  0.00s] A> SELECT recovered_bbls FROM accident WHERE report_number = 99990001
           A  -> 300.00
[  0.00s] B> SELECT recovered_bbls FROM accident WHERE report_number = 99990001
           B  -> 300.00
[  0.00s] A> UPDATE accident SET recovered_bbls = 350.00 WHERE report_number = 99990001
           A  -> UPDATE 1
[  0.00s] A> COMMIT
           A  -> COMMIT
[  0.00s] B> UPDATE accident SET recovered_bbls = 330.00 WHERE report_number = 99990001
           B  -> UPDATE 1
[  0.00s] B> COMMIT
           B  -> COMMIT
RESULT: recovered_bbls for 99990001 = 330.00  (WRONG - A's 50 barrels were silently overwritten)

